# Build artifacts and local-only state. The Dockerfile resolves paths from
# the monorepo root, so these globs apply across the whole repo.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.cache

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.env

**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Local Claude / VS Code workspace state
.claude/
**/.claude

# Misc
**/coverage
**/tmp
**/posters.html
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.md
!packages/db/prisma/migrations/**
